件"],"target":"第6.1.2章 制备、包装、标签、储存与管理"}],"heading":"制备、包装、标签、储存与管理","missing_source_classes":["制备工艺文件","包装规格与材料规范","标签内容与格式要求","储存与运输条件"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章需要撰写试验用药品（含安慰剂）的制备、包装、标签、储存与管理规范。当前允许来源中未包含任何关于KZ-sGC101片剂或安慰剂模拟片的制备工艺、包装规格与材料、标签内容与格式、储存温度与湿度条件、运输要求、药物发放与回收流程、药物 accountability 记录方式、温度监控方案或过期/损坏药物处理等项目级实施规范。该章节属于项目文件驱动型内容，在缺少对应项目文件时不得以通用原则或条件句替代。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_97c9c19afb20_41d618e5ac3ed181","section_number":"6.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:564adad0140812d0401315b4","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3dde4168e2fcd3ecbf9f:r7:04624e78a95822ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"3024314ec8abac15ce559956c89a7729d92b459295bed5589c7a5bf972c9393a","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_97c9c19afb20_3ca0b7d63139a40d:full-draft:564adad0140812d0401315b4","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:564adad0140812d0401315b4","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:37951f01a223f5139db92d521476f5a2fe19794aed517dcc7c13c280f135381c:564adad0140812d0401315b4","text_sha256":"3024314ec8abac15ce559956c89a7729d92b459295bed5589c7a5bf972c9393a"},{"content_sha256":"00e5e1415979e8e30a0f6d769ecb81b21eba15336144284b187fc19d0f5e571f","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3dde4168e2fcd3ecbf9f:revision:7","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3dde4168e2fcd3ecbf9f:r7:04624e78a95822ef","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_3dde4168e2fcd3ecbf